{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13209050","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13209050","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1320905001:0":{"text":"喂，你们几个，这么晚了还待在墓园里干嘛？不知道野外晚上很危险吗？","source_cn":"喂，你们几个，这么晚了还待在墓园里干嘛？不知道野外晚上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11B19D1DD2586DAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320905002:1":{"text":"不用担心我们，我们有能力自保。","source_cn":"不用担心我们，我们有能力自保。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC4B052B62656B3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320905003:0":{"text":"倒是你，为什么一个人待在这里？难道你不怕碰到活死人吗？","source_cn":"倒是你，为什么一个人待在这里？难道你不怕碰到活死人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2C9CD19244257D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320905004:1":{"text":"我是这里的巡墓人，监视墓园有没有出现活死人就是我的工作，我当然不怕。","source_cn":"我是这里的巡墓人，监视墓园有没有出现活死人就是我的工作...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x205656930F161562","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320905005:0":{"text":"原来这就是巡墓人呀……难怪书上都说巡墓人是白山公国特有的职业。","source_cn":"原来这就是巡墓人呀……难怪书上都说巡墓人是白山公国特有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2744A7B070FAEFA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_fem